                  "block_type": "SECTION",
                  "order_index": 30,
                  "text": "ASTRA_DELETED_PARENT_TRAP. This deleted content must never form a final context even if a stale Qdrant child point remains.",
                  "source_location": {"page_start": 4, "page_end": 4, "section_path": "deleted/reconciliation", "heading": "Deleted trap"}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
